topIssues.body:
## Observation

On a fresh-genesis OP chain with two op-nodes:

- One op-node configured with `--l2.follow.source` (LightCL)
- Another op-node configured as the sequencer

The LightCL reports `safe_l2`, `finalized_l2`, and `local_safe_l2` as the zero-value BlockRef in `optimism_syncStatus`. The sequencer reports those fields populated with the L2 genesis block.

I don't know whether this is a bug, an artifact of how follow-source initializes, or expected. Filing for visibility. It may or may not warrant a fix.

